    "description": "Mixed Brands\nBlank Audio Cassette Tape Lot - Type I & Type II High Bias\n25 Sealed Tapes\nThis comprehensive lot of vintage blank audio cassette tapes includes 25 individual tapes from leading manufacturers including TDK, Maxell, Memorex, Sony, and Fuji. The collection features a variety of tape types, primarily High Bias Type II formulations designed for CD recording and high-fidelity music reproduction, as well as standard Type I Normal Bias tapes. All tapes remain in their original factory shrink wrap, dating from the late 1990s and early 2000s.\nITEMS INCLUDED:\n1.\nMemorex CD2 110\n- 8 tapes (includes two 2-packs and four singles), Type II High Bias\n2.\nTDK D60\n- 4 tapes, Type I Normal Bias\n3.\nTDK SA 60\n- 3 tapes, Type II High Bias\n4.\nMaxell UDII-CD 74\n- 3 tapes, Type II High Bias\n5.\nMaxell XLII 90\n- 3 tapes, Type II High Bias\n6.\nSony CD-IT 100\n- 2 tapes, Type II High Bias\n7.\nSony CD-IT 54\n- 1 tape, Type II High Bias\n8.\nTDK CD Bass 120\n- 1 tape, High Output\n9.\nFuji DR-I 90\n- 1 tape, Type I Normal Bias\nCondition:\nNew old stock. All 25 tapes are factory sealed in original plastic wrap. Packaging is generally clean with minimal shelf wear; no visible tears in the shrink wrap. These are vintage items sold for collection or use.",
